   "text": "How the tables connect (no foreign keys):\nthe 3 data tables share the key thread_id\n(+ an extra index on it in each table).\ncheckpoint.channel_versions names the blob\n(channel, version) of each list/dict value.\nparent_checkpoint_id chains the steps.",
